{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BF9kRf7N94FyDKTaGjXbkR","type":"tool_result","content":"board: read and change the kanban board. People see every change as it happens.\n\nCommands\n  board show [column]              list the cards in every column, or in one\n  board card <id>                  one card in full, including its description\n  board add <title> [--column C] [--label L]...\n                                   add a card (default column: backlog)\n  board move <id> <column> [--position N]\n                                   move a card; N counts from 1 (the top); default: the bottom\n  board rename <id> <title>        change a card's title\n  board describe <id> <text>       replace a card's description\n  board label <id> [label]...      replace ALL labels of a card: list the ones to keep too;\n                                   no labels removes them all\n  board archive <id>               take a card off the board\n\nColumns (use the id): backlog = Backlog, todo = Todo, doing = In progress, done = Done\nCard ids can be written as 12 or #12. Titles and text need no quotes.\n\nExamples\n  board show todo\n  board move 12 doing --position 1\n  board add Fix the login timeout --column todo --label bug\n  board label 12 bug urgent        (card 12 now has exactly: bug, urgent)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"165cfc73-ca12-4396-b276-764324853b9c","uuid":"d697836a-2799-4ecd-8090-34f51ee7d717","timestamp":"2026-10-24T21:53:04.940Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"board: read and change the kanban board. People see every change as it happens.\n\nCommands\n  board show [column]              list the cards in every column, or in one\n  board card <id>                  one card in full, including its description\n  board add <title> [--column C] [--label L]...\n                                   add a card (default column: backlog)\n  board move <id> <column> [--position N]\n                                   move a card; N counts from 1 (the top); default: the bottom\n  board rename <id> <title>        change a card's title\n  board describe <id> <text>       replace a card's description\n  board label <id> [label]...      replace ALL labels of a card: list the ones to keep too;\n                                   no labels removes them all\n  board archive <id>               take a card off the board\n\nColumns (use the id): backlog = Backlog, todo = Todo, doing = In progress, done = Done\nCard ids can be written as 12 or #12. Titles and text need no quotes.\n\nExamples\n  board show todo\n  board move 12 doing --position 1\n  board add Fix the login timeout --column todo --label bug\n  board label 12 bug urgent        (card 12 now has exactly: bug, urgent)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01BF9kRf7N94FyDKTaGjXbkR","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
